msgstr "橋接同完全懸空外牆嘅打印速度"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Brim width"
msgstr "裙邊寬度"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Distance from model to the outermost brim line"
msgstr "模型到最外邊裙邊線嘅距離"

