msgstr "按層"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "By object"
msgstr "按物件"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Slow printing down for better layer cooling"
msgstr "減速打印以便更好嘅層冷卻"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Enable this option to slow printing speed down to make the final layer time not shorter than the layer time threshold in \"Max fan speed threshold\", so that layer can be cooled for a longer time. This can improve the cooling quality for needle and small details"
msgstr "啟用呢個選項以減慢打印速度，使最後層時間唔短於層時間閾值。"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Don't slow down outer walls"
msgstr "唔減速外牆"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "If enabled, this setting will ensure external perimeters are not slowed down to meet the minimum layer time. This is particularly helpful in the below scenarios:\n1. To avoid changes in shine when printing glossy filaments\n2. To avoid changes in external wall speed which may create slight wall artifacts that appear like Z banding\n3. To avoid printing at speeds which cause VFAs (fine artifacts) on the external walls"
msgstr "如果啟用，呢個設定將確保外部周邊唔會因為達到最小層時間而減速。呢個喺以下情況特別有幫助：\n1. 避免喺打印高光墨水時光澤度改變\n2. 避免外牆速度改變，可能造成微細牆工件，看起來像Z帶狀\n3. 避免以會導致外牆VFA(微細工件)嘅速度打印"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Cooling slowdown logic"
msgstr "冷卻減速邏輯"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Determines how the printer slows down when minimum layer time isn't reached.\n\n'Uniform cooling' slows down all print features equally (current default behavior).\n\n'Consistent surface' prioritizes slowing infill and internal perimeters first, preserving external perimeter speed for better surface finish on glossy filaments. This helps reduce VFA (Vertical Fine Artifacts) and maintains consistent surface shine."
msgstr "決定喺未達到最小層時間時打印機如何減速。\n\n\"均勻冷卻\"以相同方式減速所有打印特徵(目前預設行為)。\n\n\"一致表面\"優先減速填充同內部周邊，保留外部周邊速度以改善高光墨水上嘅表面完成度。呢個幫助減少VFA(垂直微細工件)同保持一致嘅表面光澤。"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Uniform cooling"
msgstr "均勻冷卻"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Consistent surface"
msgstr "一致表面"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Perimeter transition distance"
msgstr "周邊過渡距離"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Distance in millimeters before the end of slowed perimeters where the original print speed is gradually restored. This reduces quality issues when transitioning from slowed features to fast external perimeter printing.\n\nOnly applies when 'Consistent surface' cooling logic is selected.\nRecommended value: 5-10mm. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "喺減速周邊末端之前嘅毫米距離，其中原始打印速度逐漸恢復。呢個減少喺減速特徵同快速外部周邊打印之間過渡時嘅質素問題。\n\n僅適用於選擇\"一致表面\"冷卻邏輯時。\n推薦值：5-10毫米。設為0以禁用。"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Normal printing"
msgstr "正常打印"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "The default acceleration of both normal printing and travel except initial layer"
msgstr "呢個係首層後正常打印同空駛嘅預設加速度。"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "The acceleration of travel except initial layer"
msgstr "除初始層外嘅空駛加速度"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Short travel"
msgstr "短空駛"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Acceleration used for short travel moves near external perimeters. Short travels are moves shorter than the 'Retraction minimum travel' distance.\n\nLower values (e.g., 250-500 mm/s²) reduce ringing artifacts on sharp corners without significantly impacting print time.\n\nSet to 0 to disable (uses normal travel acceleration)."
msgstr "用於外部周邊附近短空駛移動嘅加速度。短空駛係比\"回抽最小移動距離\"短嘅移動。\n\n較低值(例如250-500毫米/秒²)減少銳角上嘅鳴叫工件，而唔會顯著影響打印時間。\n\n設為0以禁用(使用正常空駛加速度)。"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
