#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Default process profile when switch to this machine profile"
msgstr "切換到呢個機器檔案時嘅預設流程檔案"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
