msgstr "呢個係物件同筏層之間嘅Z間隙。對於可溶性介面會被忽略。"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Raft expansion"
msgstr "筏層擴展"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
