msgstr "實驗性功能。喺更換墨水時切斷前嘅回抽長度"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Long retraction when extruder change"
msgstr "切換擠出機時長回抽"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
