msgstr "確保接縫遠離懸空，對齊模式生效。"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Seam gap"
msgstr "接縫間隔"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "In order to reduce the visibility of the seam in a closed loop extrusion, the loop is interrupted and shortened by a specified amount.\nThis amount as a percentage of the current extruder diameter. The default value for this parameter is 15"
msgstr "為咗減少閉環擠出中接縫嘅可見性，迴圈會被中斷同縮短指定嘅長度。\n呢個長度以當前擠出機直徑嘅百分比表示。呢個參數嘅預設值係 15。"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Smart scarf seam application"
msgstr "智能斜拼接縫應用"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Apply scarf joints only to smooth perimeters where traditional seams do not conceal the seams at sharp corners effectively."
msgstr "只會對平滑周邊應用斜拼接縫，呢啲係傳統接縫無法有效隱藏銳角處接縫嘅位置。"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Scarf application angle threshold"
msgstr "斜拼應用角度閾值"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "This option sets the threshold angle for applying a conditional scarf joint seam.\nIf the seam angle within the perimeter loop exceeds this value (indicating the absence of sharp corners), a scarf joint seam will be used. The default value is 155°."
msgstr "呢個選項設定判斷係咪應用條件性斜拼接縫嘅角度閾值。\n如果周邊迴圈內嘅接縫角度超過呢個數值（表示冇銳角），會使用斜拼接縫。預設值係 155°。"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Scarf around entire wall"
msgstr "圍繞整個牆嘅斜拼"

#. reviewed-category: slicing-printing
#. review-status: agent-drafted
