msgid "Note: "
msgstr "備註： "

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Controls the printed height of each layer."
msgstr "控制每層嘅打印高度。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "A larger layer height prints faster but shows more obvious layer lines.\nA smaller layer height gives finer curved surfaces but takes longer to print.\nIf the layer height is too small while the speed is too high, extrusion can't keep up and the surface is left starved and fuzzy."
msgstr "較大嘅層高打印得快啲，但層紋較明顯。\n較小嘅層高可獲得更細緻嘅曲面，不過打印時間會更長。\n若層高太細而速度太高，擠出跟唔上，表面就會缺料同毛糙。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Recommended layer height is 20%-70% of the nozzle diameter."
msgstr "建議層高為噴嘴直徑嘅 20%-70%。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Controls the thickness of the model's first layer extruded onto the heat bed, affecting how well the first layer bonds to the plate."
msgstr "控制模型第一層擠出至熱床嘅厚度，影響第一層與打印板嘅黏合程度。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Too small, and the first layer is sensitive to bed flatness and prone to print defects.\nToo large, and the first layer's width-to-height ratio becomes too small, which hurts material adhesion."
msgstr "太細會使第一層對熱床平整度敏感，容易產生打印瑕疵。\n太厚會使第一層嘅寬高比過細，唔利於材料黏合。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Usually set to half the nozzle diameter."
msgstr "通常設定為噴嘴直徑嘅一半。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "For the mixed-color filament feature. When enabled, layers that use mixed-color filament are split proportionally into thinner sub-layers for a more even color blend."
msgstr "用於混色墨水功能。啟用後，使用混色墨水嘅層將按比例分割為更薄嘅子層，以獲得更均勻嘅混色效果。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "When off, colors change per full layer, so the blend is coarser and less even.\nWhen on, the sub-layers interleave more densely for a more even blend, but printing takes longer."
msgstr "關閉時，顏色依完整層切換，因此混色較粗糙且較唔均勻。\n開啟時，子層交錯更密集，混色更均勻，不過打印時間會更長。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Recommended only when using mixed-color filament, to get a better layered-color effect."
msgstr "僅建議喺使用混色墨水時啟用，以獲得更佳嘅層次色彩效果。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Controls where each layer's outer wall starts and ends."
msgstr "控制每層外壁嘅起始同結束位置。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "That point can leave a small blob or seam line, so choosing a suitable position reduces the seam's impact on the model's appearance."
msgstr "該點可能留下細小結塊或接縫線，所以揀選合適位置可減少接縫對模型外觀嘅影響。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Prints only a single wall loop on top surfaces so the top is filled as much as possible by the infill pattern, for a more consistent look."
msgstr "僅喺頂面打印單一壁迴圈，使頂部盡可能由填充圖案填滿，以獲得更一致嘅外觀。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "On sloped or domed surfaces this option worsens the stair-stepping, so it is not recommended there."
msgstr "喺斜面或圓頂表面上，呢個選項會加劇階梯效應，因此唔建議喺該處使用。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Recommended only for flat top surfaces."
msgstr "僅建議用於平坦頂面。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Uses only a single wall on the model's first layer (the one touching the bed) so the largest possible area is filled by the first-layer infill pattern, for a more consistent look."
msgstr "喺模型第一層（接觸熱床嘅嗰一層）僅使用單一壁，使最大面積由第一層填充圖案填滿，以獲得更一致嘅外觀。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "When off, the first layer uses multiple wall loops.\nWhen on, the infill is more continuous and the bottom is flatter, but the first-layer edge outline is slightly weaker."
msgstr "關閉時，第一層使用多個壁迴圈。\n開啟時，填充更連續且底部更平坦，不過第一層邊緣輪廓會稍微較弱。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Controls the number of wall loops in each layer's shell, a key factor in a model's strength."
msgstr "控制每層外殼嘅壁迴圈數量，係模型強度嘅關鍵因素。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "More walls give higher strength but use more material and time;\nfewer walls print faster and save material but reduce strength and may let the infill pattern show through the surface."
msgstr "更多壁可提供更高強度，不過會使用更多材料同時間；\n較少壁可加快打印速度且節省材料，不過會降低強度，填充圖案可能透出表面。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "2-3 loops is recommended for typical models; increase it for functional parts."
msgstr "2-3 圈建議用於一般模型；功能性零件可增加。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "At the boundary between walled and wall-less areas, this embeds the wall into the infill region that has no outer wall on alternating layers, so the wall and infill connect more firmly."
msgstr "喺有壁與無壁區域嘅邊界處，呢個選項會將壁嵌入交替層上冇外壁嘅填充區域，使壁與填充連接更牢固。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "It only handles boundaries where one side has a wall and the other has zero walls; ordinary wall-to-infill boundaries inside a part are left alone.\nEmbedding every other layer creates a staggered interlock that is stronger than a flush joint."
msgstr "僅處理一側有壁而另一側無壁嘅邊界；零件內一般壁同填充嘅邊界則唔理。\n每隔一層嵌入可形成交錯互鎖，比齊平接合更牢固。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Use it when a modifier turns a region into wall-less infill that still needs to bond firmly to the surrounding shell. Not needed when both sides print normal walls."
msgstr "當修改器將某區域變為無壁填充，但仍需同周圍外殼牢固黏合時使用。兩側皆打印正常壁時唔需要。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Adds an extra wall loop on odd layers while leaving even layers unchanged."
msgstr "喺奇數層增加一個額外壁迴圈，偶數層則保持唔變。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Adding a wall every other layer strengthens the bond between layers without adding one throughout, improving layer bonding and part strength while avoiding the material and time cost of a full extra wall."
msgstr "每隔一層增加壁可強化層間黏合，而毋須每層都增加，提升層間黏合同零件強度，同時避免完整額外壁嘅材料同時間成本。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Requires sparse infill; not applicable in vase mode."
msgstr "需要稀疏填充；唔適用於花樽模式。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "The toolpath pattern for the topmost solid infill; it mainly affects the flatness and look of the top surface."
msgstr "最頂部實心填充嘅工具路徑圖案；主要影響頂面嘅平整度同外觀。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Controls the infill toolpath of the model's bottom surface, affecting bottom texture and flatness."
msgstr "控制模型底面嘅填充工具路徑，影響底部紋理同平整度。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Bridging areas are not affected by this parameter."
msgstr "橋接區域唔受呢個參數影響。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Controls the number of solid top shell layers, including the top surface."
msgstr "控制實心頂部外殼層數，包括頂面。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "More layers make the top shell thicker and less likely to reveal the infill beneath.\nIf layers x layer height is less than the top shell thickness, the slicer adds layers automatically."
msgstr "層數越多，頂部外殼就越厚，越唔易顯露下方填充。\n若層數 × 層高細過頂部外殼厚度，切片器會自動增加層數。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Sets a minimum thickness for the solid top shell, preventing it from becoming too thin at small layer heights."
msgstr "設定實心頂部外殼嘅最小厚度，防止喺細層高時變得太薄。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Set to 0 to disable this and let the layer count alone decide.\nIf the thickness from layers x layer height is not enough, the slicer adds top shell layers automatically."
msgstr "設為 0 可停用呢項，僅由層數決定。\n若層數 × 層高嘅厚度唔夠，切片器會自動增加頂部外殼層。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Controls the number of solid bottom shell layers, including the bottom surface."
msgstr "控制實心底部外殼層數，包括底面。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "More layers make the bottom more solid but take longer.\nIf layer height x layers is less than the bottom shell thickness, the slicer adds layers automatically."
msgstr "層數越多，底部越堅固，不過耗時更長。\n若層高 × 層數細過底部外殼厚度，切片器會自動增加層數。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Sets a minimum thickness for the solid bottom shell, preventing it from becoming too thin at small layer heights."
msgstr "設定實心底部外殼嘅最小厚度，防止喺細層高時變得太薄。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Set to 0 to disable this and let the layer count alone decide.\nIf the thickness from the layer count is not enough, the slicer adds bottom shell layers automatically."
msgstr "設為 0 可停用呢項，僅由層數決定。\n若層數嘅厚度唔夠，切片器會自動增加底部外殼層。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Controls how many layers the top-surface color penetrates downward, keeping other filament colors inside from showing through."
msgstr "控制頂面顏色向下滲透嘅層數，防止內部其他墨水顏色透出。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Fewer layers make color bleed-through more likely.\nMore layers reduce bleed-through but increase the number of filament changes.\nTo keep the downward penetration from affecting the model's side colors, the penetrated area shrinks layer by layer."
msgstr "層數越少，顏色透出嘅可能性就越大。\n增加層數可減少透色，不過會增加換墨水次數。\n為避免向下滲透影響模型側面顏色，滲透區域會逐層縮細。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Controls how many layers the bottom-surface color penetrates upward, keeping other filament colors inside from showing through."
msgstr "控制底面顏色向上滲透嘅層數，防止內部其他墨水顏色透出。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Fewer layers make color bleed-through more likely.\nMore layers reduce bleed-through but increase the number of filament changes.\nTo keep the upward penetration from affecting the model's side colors, the penetrated area shrinks layer by layer."
msgstr "層數越少，顏色透出嘅可能性就越大。\n增加層數可減少透色，不過會增加換墨水次數。\n為避免向上滲透影響模型側面顏色，滲透區域會逐層縮細。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Controls the toolpath pattern of internal solid infill, applied to the solid layers between the top and bottom shells and to internal solid regions."
msgstr "控制內部實心填充嘅工具路徑圖案，套用於頂部同底部外殼之間嘅實心層及內部實心區域。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "If detection of narrow internal solid infill is enabled, small regions use the concentric pattern automatically."
msgstr "若啟用狹窄內部實心填充偵測，細區域將自動使用同心圖案。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Controls how dense the model's internal sparse infill is."
msgstr "控制模型內部稀疏填充嘅密度。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "10-15% is recommended for typical models; raise it for functional parts.\n100% means fully solid, where only the Concentric, Rectilinear, Monotonic, Monotonic Line, Aligned Rectilinear, Hilbert Curve, Archimedean Chords, and Octagram Spiral patterns are available."
msgstr "10-15% 建議用於一般模型；功能性零件可提高。\n100% 表示完全實心，此時僅可使用同心、直線、單調、單調線、對齊直線、希爾伯特曲線、阿基米德弦及八角螺旋圖案。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Enables multi-line infill, printing each infill path as several parallel lines side by side."
msgstr "啟用多線填充，將每條填充路徑打印為多條並排嘅平行線。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Higher values make the infill beams thicker and stronger but use more material and time;\n1 is ordinary single-line infill."
msgstr "數值越高，填充梁就越粗、強度越高，不過需要更多材料同時間；\n1 為一般單線填充。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Supported by patterns such as Line, Grid, Gyroid, Honeycomb, Cubic, and Lightning."
msgstr "支援嘅圖案包括直線、網格、迴旋、蜂巢、立方及閃電等。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Controls the toolpath structure of the internal sparse infill."
msgstr "控制內部稀疏填充嘅工具路徑結構。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Supports are removable structures printed under overhangs and steep angles to hold up later layers and prevent sagging."
msgstr "支撐係打印喺懸空同陡峭角度下方嘅可移除結構，用於支撐後續層並防止下垂。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "When enabled, supports are generated for overhangs and steep angles, giving more stable prints, but they must be removed and may leave marks.\nRecommended when the model has obvious overhangs."
msgstr "啟用後，將為懸空同陡峭角度產生支撐，使打印更穩定，不過必須移除且可能留下痕跡。\n當模型有明顯懸空時建議使用。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Selects the support shape and how it is generated; Normal (auto) and Tree (auto) are generated automatically based on overhangs."
msgstr "揀選支撐形狀及其產生方式；一般（自動）同樹狀（自動）會根據懸空自動產生。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Normal supports are more regular and stable; tree supports touch the model less and are easier to remove.\nChoose a manual mode when you need precise control."
msgstr "一般支撐較規則且穩定；樹狀支撐接觸模型較少，較易移除。\n需要精確控制時，請揀選手動模式。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Manual mode is used together with the support-painting tool in the gizmo toolbar."
msgstr "手動模式需搭配 gizmo 工具列中嘅支撐塗色工具使用。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Generates support for surfaces whose overhang angle is below the threshold; it is customizable in the automatic modes."
msgstr "為懸空角度低於門檻值嘅表面產生支撐；可喺自動模式中自訂。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "A smaller threshold supports only near-horizontal large overhangs, giving less support but possibly leaving gentle slopes unsupported.\nA larger threshold also supports more slopes, giving more support."
msgstr "較細門檻值僅支撐接近水平嘅大型懸空，支撐較少，不過可能使緩坡無支撐。\n較大門檻值也會支撐更多斜面，提供更多支撐。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "A common default of 30 degrees balances print stability against the amount of support used."
msgstr "常見預設值 30 度可喺打印穩定性同支撐用量之間取得平衡。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Generates support only from the build plate, not on the model's surfaces."
msgstr "僅從打印板產生支撐，唔喺模型表面產生。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "When off, support may grow on model surfaces for more complete coverage but is more likely to leave marks.\nWhen on, all support starts from the plate, keeping model surfaces cleaner, but some overhangs may go unsupported."
msgstr "關閉時，支撐可能生長喺模型表面以獲得更完整覆蓋，不過更容易留下痕跡。\n開啟時，所有支撐皆從打印板開始，保持模型表面較乾淨，不過部分懸空可能無支撐。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Recommended when appearance matters."
msgstr "外觀為優先考量時建議選用。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "The support interface is a denser contact layer where support meets the model; it holds the model steady, eases removal, and reduces surface marks. This sets the filament used for that contact surface."
msgstr "支撐介面係支撐同模型接觸處較緻密嘅接觸層；可固定模型、易於移除並減少表面痕跡。呢個可設定該接觸面使用嘅墨水。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "By default the interface uses the same filament as the model, which can make removal harder.\nAssigning an easy-release filament makes the contact surface easier to remove and cleaner, but adds filament changes."
msgstr "預設情況下，介面使用同模型相同嘅墨水，呢會提高移除作業嘅難度。\n指派易剝離墨水可使接觸面更易移除且更乾淨，不過會增加換墨水次數。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "The filament used to print the support body and the raft."
msgstr "用於打印支撐本體同底筏嘅墨水。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "By default the support uses the same filament as the model, matching the model filament of each layer in multi-filament prints.\nAssigning a different filament can make removal easier or lower cost, but adds filament-change time."
msgstr "預設情況下，支撐使用同模型相同嘅墨水，喺多墨水打印中匹配每層嘅模型墨水。\n指派唔同墨水可提升移除便利性或降低成本，不過會增加換墨水時間。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Prints detached outline loops (a skirt) around the model to purge the nozzle and stabilize extrusion before printing starts."
msgstr "喺模型周圍打印分離嘅輪廓迴圈（裙邊），以喺打印開始前清除噴嘴並穩定擠出。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "More loops purge more thoroughly but use more material; set to 0 to disable the skirt."
msgstr "更多迴圈可更徹底清除，不過材料消耗更多；設為 0 可停用裙邊。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Controls how many layers the skirt is printed."
msgstr "控制裙邊打印嘅層數。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "During the first few layers, a taller skirt can partly block cold air around the model, keeping a warm microclimate at the base of the model and reducing the early warping risk caused by shrinkage.\nThe default is 1 layer."
msgstr "喺前幾層，較高嘅裙邊可部分阻擋模型周圍嘅冷空氣，喺模型底部保持溫暖嘅微氣候，並降低因收縮造成嘅早期翹曲風險。\n預設為 1 層。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Requires the skirt loop count to be greater than 0."
msgstr "需要裙邊迴圈數大於 0。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "A brim is a single-layer band of material added around the base of the model and joined to its first layer, a reinforcing border that fights warping and keeps adhesion."
msgstr "底邊係新增喺模型底部周圍並同第一層連接嘅單層材料帶，做為強化邊界，抑制翹曲並維持貼附效果。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "This controls the type of brim (a band joined to the model's first layer) used to improve bed adhesion and reduce warping.\nThe default is Auto."
msgstr "呢個控制底邊類型（同模型第一層連接嘅材料帶），用於改善熱床黏合並減少翹曲。\n預設為自動。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "The distance from the model to the outermost brim line."
msgstr "模型至最外側底邊線嘅距離。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "A larger width improves bed adhesion and resists warping but uses more material and is harder to clean up."
msgstr "較大寬度可改善熱床黏合並抑制翹曲，不過材料消耗更多且較難清理。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "After a color or filament change, the printer purges residual filament and stabilizes nozzle pressure on a separate prime tower before resuming the model, reducing color mixing, starvation, and surface defects."
msgstr "喺換色或換墨水後，打印機將喺獨立嘅填充塔上清除殘留墨水並穩定噴嘴壓力，然後再繼續打印模型，以減少混色、缺料及表面瑕疵。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Off: saves material and takes less bed space, but residual filament during a color change may land on the model and cause color mixing, stringing, or local starvation.\nOn: cleaner color transitions and more consistent multi-color prints, but it uses extra material and time and takes up bed space."
msgstr "關閉：節省墨水且佔用較少熱床空間，不過換色期間嘅殘留墨水可能落喺模型上，造成混色、拉絲或局部缺料。\n開啟：色彩轉換更乾淨且多色打印更一致，不過會額外消耗墨水同時間，並佔用熱床空間。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Mutually exclusive with by-object printing and independent support layer height."
msgstr "同依物件打印及獨立支撐層高互斥。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Controls the horizontal size of the prime tower."
msgstr "控制填充塔嘅水平尺寸。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "A larger width gives more purge margin and a more stable tower, but uses more material and bed space."
msgstr "寬度越大，清除餘量越高、塔體越穩，材料同熱床空間耗用增加。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "The width cannot be customized when the rib outer wall is enabled."
msgstr "啟用肋條外壁時，無法自訂寬度。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Adds four corner ribs to the prime tower's outer wall to improve its stability."
msgstr "喺填充塔外壁增加四個角落肋條，以提升塔體穩定性。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Recommended for tall prime towers, stickier materials such as PETG, or frequent color changes; turn it off when bed space is tight and the tower is short so the width can be narrowed."
msgstr "建議用於高填充塔、PETG 等黏性較高嘅材料，或頻繁換色嘅場景；當熱床空間緊湊且塔體唔高時可關閉，以便縮細寬度。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Uses part of the transition filament after a change to print the object's internal infill, reducing waste and print time."
msgstr "將換墨水後嘅部分過渡墨水用於打印物件內部填充，減少浪費同打印時間。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Enable it on opaque parts to save material; turn it off for transparent or thin-walled parts, or when the internal color matters."
msgstr "喺唔透明零件上啟用可節省材料；透明或薄壁零件，或重視內部顏色時請關閉。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Uses the transition filament after a change to print the model's supports, reducing waste and time."
msgstr "將換墨水後嘅過渡墨水用於打印模型支撐，減少浪費同時間。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Enabling it saves material, but the supports may show mixed colors."
msgstr "啟用可節省材料，不過支撐可能顯示混色。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Takes effect when printing multiple filaments through the same nozzle."
msgstr "透過同一噴嘴打印多種墨水時生效。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Chooses whether to print the whole plate layer by layer, or to finish one object before starting the next."
msgstr "揀選逐層打印整個打印板，或完成一個物件後再開始下一個。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Use By Layer for typical multi-part or multi-color prints; consider By Object for many small parts or to limit the impact of a mid-print failure, and check the clearances and prime-tower restrictions."
msgstr "一般多零件或多色打印請使用「逐層打印」；大量細零件或需限制打印中途失敗影響時，可考慮「依物件打印」，並檢查間隙同填充塔限制。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Prints in a continuous spiral along the outer contour, building the whole model in one line, usually with no seam on the sides."
msgstr "沿外輪廓以連續螺旋打印，以單線建構整個模型，側面通常無接縫。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "When on, the model has no top shell, no infill, and usually only a single wall, so it is weak and conflicts with support, top shell layers, and several other settings.\nIt is best for single, thin-walled, open-top models."
msgstr "開啟時，模型冇頂部外殼、冇填充，且通常僅有單一壁，因此強度較低，並同支撐、頂部外殼層數及其他多項設定衝突。\n最適合單一、薄壁、頂部開放嘅模型。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Requires top shell layers to be 0 and is not compatible with support."
msgstr "需要頂部外殼層數為 0，且同支撐唔相容。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Takes one photo per layer during printing and compiles a timelapse video when the print finishes."
msgstr "打印時每層拍攝一張照片，並喺打印完成後合成縮時影片。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Selects the timelapse mode here; whether the feature actually runs is toggled on the send-to-print page."
msgstr "喺呢到揀選縮時攝影模式；功能係否實際執行則喺傳送至打印頁面切換。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Randomly jitters the wall toolpaths so the outer surface takes on a rough, matte, fuzzy texture."
msgstr "隨機抖動壁工具路徑，使外表面呈現粗糙、霧面、毛邊嘅紋理。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "It affects only walls; the top and bottom surfaces are unchanged.\nUseful for decorative parts and figure shells; turn it off when dimensions are critical or a smooth surface is needed."
msgstr "僅影響壁；頂面同底面保持唔變。\n適用於裝飾零件同公仔外殼；尺寸要求嚴格或需要平滑表面時請關閉。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Selects how the fuzzy texture is generated."
msgstr "揀選毛邊紋理嘅產生方式。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "There are three generator modes; pick the one that suits your needs."
msgstr "有三種產生器模式；請揀選適合你需求嘅模式。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Determines the randomness of the fuzzy texture, which affects the style of the surface texture."
msgstr "決定毛邊紋理嘅隨機程度，會影響表面紋理嘅樣式。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Several noise types are available; pick the one that suits your needs."
msgstr "提供多種雜訊類型；請揀選適合你需求嘅類型。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Controls the average distance between the random points inserted along the wall path when generating fuzzy skin."
msgstr "控制產生毛邊時，沿壁路徑插入隨機點之間嘅平均距離。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "A larger value spaces the random points farther apart for a coarser grain, but uses fewer path points, so slicing and printing stay faster and the G-code file stays smaller.\nA smaller value packs the points closer together for a finer, more even grain, but adds path points, so slicing and printing slow down and the G-code file grows."
msgstr "數值越大，隨機點間距越遠，紋理顆粒越粗，不過使用嘅路徑點數越少，因此切片同打印速度更快，G-code 檔案也更細。\n數值越細，隨機點越密集，紋理顆粒越細緻均勻，不過會增加路徑點，因此切片同打印變慢，G-code 檔案也變大。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "If it is too small, the software disables fuzzy skin because the point spacing is too small (to avoid abnormal paths)."
msgstr "若數值過細，軟件將停用毛邊，因為點間距太細（為避免異常路徑）。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Controls the width of the wall-path jitter when generating fuzzy skin, that is, the depth of the texture."
msgstr "控制產生毛邊時壁路徑抖動嘅寬度，即紋理嘅深度。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "A larger value makes the texture deeper and more pronounced with a stronger grain, but the outline expands, dimensional accuracy drops, and the wall may develop gaps and lose strength.\nThe default is about 0.3 mm; keep it below the outer wall's line width."
msgstr "數值越大，紋理越深、顆粒感更明顯，不過輪廓會擴張，尺寸精確度下降，且壁可能產生間隙，強度降低。\n預設值約為 0.3 mm；請保持低於外壁線寬。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "When it exceeds the line width, the generator's Extrusion and Combined modes stop working and only Displacement is used."
msgstr "當數值超過線寬時，產生器嘅「擠出」同「組合」模式將停止運作，僅使用「位移」模式。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Determines whether the fuzzy effect is also applied to the first layer."
msgstr "決定係否也將毛邊效果套用至第一層。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "When on, the first-layer side walls also get the fuzzy texture.\nUsually keep it off; enable it only when the bottom edge needs a consistent texture and bed adhesion is good."
msgstr "開啟時，第一層側壁也會有毛邊紋理。\n通常保持關閉；僅喺底邊需要一致紋理且熱床黏合良好時啟用。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Places the seam preferentially at concave or convex corners and shortens travel moves; suited to models with distinct edges."
msgstr "優先將接縫置於凹角或凸角，並縮短移動；適合具有明顯邊緣嘅模型。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Stacks each layer's seam into one vertical line, keeping the marks concentrated and easy to hide."
msgstr "將每層嘅接縫堆疊成一條垂直線，使痕跡集中且易於隱藏。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Puts the seam on the model's back, suited to display models with a fixed orientation."
msgstr "將接縫置於模型背面，適合具有固定方向嘅展示模型。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Scatters the seam across layers to avoid a vertical line, though small stray bumps may appear on the surface."
msgstr "將接縫分散喺各層以避免垂直線，不過表面可能出現細小零星凸起。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "All top surfaces print with the normal number of wall loops."
msgstr "所有頂面皆以正常壁迴圈數量打印。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Applies to every flat upward-facing top surface, for the widest coverage."
msgstr "套用至每個平坦朝上嘅頂面，涵蓋範圍最廣。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Applies only to the model's uppermost surface; middle-layer top surfaces are still handled normally."
msgstr "僅套用至模型嘅最上層表面；中間層頂面仍正常處理。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Analyzes the model and computes the needed brim width and placement; recommended for most models."
msgstr "分析模型並計算所需嘅底邊寬度同位置；建議用於大多數模型。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Generates a brim only on the outer contour to strengthen outer adhesion."
msgstr "僅喺外輪廓產生底邊，以強化外部黏合。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Generates a brim in inner holes only."
msgstr "僅喺內部孔洞產生底邊。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Generates a brim on both the outer contour and inner holes."
msgstr "同時喺外輪廓同內部孔洞產生底邊。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Generates the brim by painting or local reinforcement, suited to sharp corners prone to warping."
msgstr "透過塗色或局部強化產生底邊，適合容易翹曲嘅尖角。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "No brim is generated; the bottom stays cleaner but bed adhesion is weaker."
msgstr "唔產生底邊；底部較乾淨，不過熱床黏合較弱。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "All objects rise together, layer by layer."
msgstr "所有物件逐層一起上升。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Finishes one object before starting the next; has placement clearance requirements."
msgstr "完成一個物件後再開始下一個；有放置間隙要求。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "A snapshot is taken directly after each layer."
msgstr "每層完成後直接拍攝快照。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "After each layer the toolhead moves to the excess chute before the snapshot for a cleaner shot; filament may leak during the shot, so a prime tower is required to wipe the nozzle and is generated even for single-color jobs."
msgstr "每層完成後，工具頭會先移至廢料槽再拍攝快照，以獲得更乾淨嘅畫面；拍攝期間墨水可能滲出，因此需要填充塔來擦拭噴嘴，即使係單色打印也會產生填充塔。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "No fuzzy skin is added automatically, but you can still paint it on locally."
msgstr "唔會自動新增毛邊，不過你仍可喺局部塗色。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Adds fuzzy skin only to the outermost contour; inner holes stay smooth."
msgstr "僅將毛邊新增至最外輪廓；內部孔洞保持平滑。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Adds fuzzy skin to both the outer contour and inner holes."
msgstr "同時將毛邊新增至外輪廓同內部孔洞。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Every wall line jitters, for the strongest effect but possibly larger dimensional deviation."
msgstr "每條壁線皆抖動，效果最強，不過可能造成較大尺寸偏差。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Turns fuzzy skin fully off; even painting has no effect."
msgstr "完全關閉毛邊；即使塗色也無效。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "The nozzle shifts sideways to form the texture, giving a strong 3D feel but possible gaps between loops."
msgstr "噴嘴橫向偏移以形成紋理，具有強烈 3D 感，不過迴圈之間可能產生間隙。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "The path stays straight and only the extruded amount varies, keeping walls denser."
msgstr "路徑保持直線，僅改變擠出量，使壁更密實。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Displacement plus extrusion; looks close to displacement while filling the gaps between loops."
msgstr "位移加擠出；外觀接近位移，同時填充迴圈之間嘅間隙。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Uniform random noise with a fine, grainy texture and no clear direction."
msgstr "均勻隨機雜訊，具有細緻顆粒紋理且無明顯方向。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Smooth transitions between layers for a more even, continuous texture with soft, regular undulation."
msgstr "層間平滑過渡，形成更均勻連續嘅紋理，具有柔和規則嘅起伏。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Similar to Perlin but clumpier, with clustered bumps and flat areas, like clouds."
msgstr "類似 Perlin 但團塊感更重，具有叢集凸起同平坦區域，如同雲朵。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Sharp jagged ridges with peaks and fine grooves, giving a marble-like texture."
msgstr "尖銳鋸齒狀脊線，具有峰同細溝，呈現大理石般紋理。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Divides the surface into cells and offsets each as a whole, forming a patchwork stepped texture."
msgstr "將表面分割為單元並整體偏移每個單元，形成拼布階梯狀紋理。"

