msgid "An archive keeps the data file and its sidecar together. Paths inside are always relative."
msgstr "壓縮包會將資料檔案同佢嘅旁檔放喺一齊。裏面嘅路徑永遠係相對路徑。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Compression method"
msgstr "壓縮方法"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "LZMA2 (default): best general ratio, multi-threaded. LZMA: single-threaded. PPMd: best for text. BZip2/Deflate: compatibility, weaker ratio."
msgstr "LZMA2（預設）：最佳通用比例、多線程。LZMA：單線程。PPMd：最適合文字。BZip2/Deflate：相容性、較弱比例。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Compression level"
msgstr "壓縮級別"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Higher levels use larger dictionaries: slower and hungrier for RAM, but smaller."
msgstr "較高嘅級別會使用較大嘅字典：較慢並且更耗記憶體，但檔案較細。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Dictionary size"
msgstr "字典大細"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "LZMA/LZMA2 dictionary or PPMd memory. Compression needs about 11x this much RAM; extraction needs this much. Ignored by BZip2 and Deflate."
msgstr "LZMA/LZMA2 字典或 PPMd 記憶體。壓縮需要約 11 倍嘅記憶體；解壓需要呢個份量。BZip2 同 Deflate 會忽略。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Word size (0 = default)"
msgstr "字組大細（0 = 預設）"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Fast bytes for LZMA/LZMA2/Deflate (5-273) or model order for PPMd (2-32). Larger is a little slower and a little smaller."
msgstr "LZMA/LZMA2/Deflate 嘅快速字節 (5-273) 或 PPMd 嘅模型階級 (2-32)。較大值會慢少少、細少少。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Solid archive (files share one compression block)"
msgstr "固體壓縮包（檔案共享一個壓縮區塊）"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Solid gives a better ratio; extracting one file then decompresses its whole block."
msgstr "固體可以取得更好嘅比例；提取一個檔案然後會解壓佢整個區塊。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "solid archive block"
msgstr "固體壓縮包區塊"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Solid block size"
msgstr "固體區塊大細"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "How much data shares one block. Smaller blocks extract single files faster; larger blocks compress better."
msgstr "幾多資料共享一個區塊。較細嘅區塊可以較快提取單一檔案；較大嘅區塊壓縮得較好。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Threads (0 = all cores)"
msgstr "線程（0 = 所有核心）"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "LZMA2 memory grows with the thread count; LZMA and PPMd compress on one thread regardless."
msgstr "LZMA2 記憶體會隨線程數量增加；LZMA 同 PPMd 不論如何都係單線程壓縮。"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
msgid "Split into volumes (empty = single file)"
msgstr "分割成磁碟（空白 = 單一檔案）"

#. reviewed-category: preferences
#. review-status: agent-drafted
